my commandments,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.1\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.2\"><span class=\"label\">2</span><span class=\"content\">for </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 16; ch. 4:10; 9:11; 10:27; See Ps. 91:16 </span></span><span class=\"content\">length of days and years of life</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.2\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 1:33; Ps. 119:165</span></span><span class=\"content\">peace they will add to you.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.2\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.3\"><span class=\"label\">3</span><span class=\"content\">Let not </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Ps. 85:10] </span></span><span class=\"content\">steadfast love and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 20:28; Isa. 59:14] </span></span><span class=\"content\">faithfulness forsake you;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.3\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [ch. 1:9; 6:21; 7:3]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">bind them around your neck;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.3\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 7:3; [Jer. 17:1; 2 Cor. 3:3]  </span></span><span class=\"content\">write them on the tablet of your heart.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.3\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.4\"><span class=\"label\">4</span><span class=\"content\">So you will </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[1 Sam. 2:26; Luke 2:52; Rom. 14:18] </span></span><span class=\"content\">find favor and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 111:10</span></span><span class=\"content\">good success</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">3:4 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">repute</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.4\"><span class=\"content\">in the sight of God and man.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.4\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.5\"><span class=\"label\">5</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 37:3, 5   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Trust in the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\"> with all your heart,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.5\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Jer. 9:23]</span></span><span class=\"content\">do not lean on your own understanding.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.5\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.6\"><span class=\"label\">6</span><span class=\"content\">In all your ways </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Chr. 28:9 </span></span><span class=\"content\">acknowledge him,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.6\"><span class=\"content\">and he </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Ps. 73:24]</span></span><span class=\"content\">will make straight your paths.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.6\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.7\"><span class=\"label\">7</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [Rom. 12:16]; See ch. 12:15   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Be not wise in your own eyes;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Job 1:1; 28:28  </span></span><span class=\"content\">fear the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\">, and turn away from evil.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.8\"><span class=\"label\">8</span><span class=\"content\">It will be </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 4:22] </span></span><span class=\"content\">healing to your flesh</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">3:8 </span><span class=\"ft\">Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">navel</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.8\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Job 21:24</span></span><span class=\"content\">refreshment</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">3:8 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">medicine</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> to your bones.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.8\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.9\"><span class=\"label\">9</span><span class=\"content\">Honor the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\"> with your wealth</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.9\"><span class=\"content\">and with </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ex. 23:19; 34:26; Deut. 26:2</span></span><span class=\"content\">the firstfruits of all your produce;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.9\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.10\"><span class=\"label\">10</span><span class=\"content\">then your </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Deut. 28:8</span></span><span class=\"content\">barns will be filled with plenty,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.10\"><span class=\"content\">and your vats will be bursting with wine.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.10\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.11\"><span class=\"label\">11</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    Cited Heb. 12:5, 6; See Job 5:17  </span></span><span class=\"content\">My son, do not despise the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\">&#8217;s discipline</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.11\"><span class=\"content\">or be weary of his reproof,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.11\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.12\"><span class=\"label\">12</span><span class=\"content\">for the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\"> reproves him whom he loves,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.12\"><span class=\"content\">as </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Deut. 8:5; [1 Cor. 11:32]</span></span><span class=\"content\">a father the son in whom he delights.</span></span></div><div class=\"s1\"><span class=\"heading\">Blessed Is the One Who Finds Wisdom</span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.12\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.13\"><span class=\"label\">13</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 8:34, 35  </span></span><span class=\"content\">Blessed is the one who finds wisdom,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.13\"><span class=\"content\">and the one who gets understanding,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.13\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.14\"><span class=\"label\">14</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See Job 28:15-19   </span></span><span class=\"content\">for the gain from her is better than gain from silver</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.14\"><span class=\"content\">and her profit better than </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 8:10, 19; 16:16; Ps. 19:10</span></span><span class=\"content\">gold.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.14\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.15\"><span class=\"label\">15</span><span class=\"content\">She is more precious than </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Job 28:18 </span></span><span class=\"content\">jewels,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.15\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 8:11</span></span><span class=\"content\">nothing you desire can compare with her.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.15\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.16\"><span class=\"label\">16</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ver. 2   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Long life is in her right hand;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.16\"><span class=\"content\">in her left hand are </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 8:18; 22:4</span></span><span class=\"content\">riches and honor.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.16\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.17\"><span class=\"label\">17</span><span class=\"content\">Her </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Matt. 11:29, 30]</span></span><span class=\"content\">ways are ways of pleasantness,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.17\"><span class=\"content\">and all her paths are peace.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.17\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.18\"><span class=\"label\">18</span><span class=\"content\">She is </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 11:30; 13:12; 15:4; Gen. 2:9; 3:22; Rev. 2:7; 22:2 </span></span><span class=\"content\">a tree of life to those who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 4:13</span></span><span class=\"content\">lay hold of her;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.18\"><span class=\"content\">those who hold her fast are called blessed.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.18\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.19\"><span class=\"label\">19</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 8:27; Ps. 104:5, 24; 136:5  </span></span><span class=\"content\">The </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\"> by wisdom founded the earth;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.19\"><span class=\"content\">by understanding </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 8:27; Ps. 104:5, 24; 136:5</span></span><span class=\"content\">he established the heavens;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.19\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.20\"><span class=\"label\">20</span><span class=\"content\">by his knowledge </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Gen. 7:11; [Job 38:8] </span></span><span class=\"content\">the deeps broke open,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.20\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Job 36:28</span></span><span class=\"content\">the clouds drop down the dew.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.20\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.21\"><span class=\"label\">21</span><span class=\"content\">My son, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 4:21</span></span><span class=\"content\">do not lose sight of these&#8212;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.21\"><span class=\"content\">keep sound wisdom and discretion,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.21\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.22\"><span class=\"label\">22</span><span class=\"content\">and they will be </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 4:22 </span></span><span class=\"content\">life for your soul</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.22\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 1:9]</span></span><span class=\"content\">adornment for your neck.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.22\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.23\"><span class=\"label\">23</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 10:9; [ch. 28:18; Ps. 91:11]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Then you will walk on your way securely,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.23\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 4:12; Ps. 91:12  </span></span><span class=\"content\">and your foot will not stumble.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.23\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.24\"><span class=\"label\">24</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [ch. 6:22; Ps. 3:5; 4:8]; See Job 11:19   </span></span><span class=\"content\">If you lie down, you will not be afraid;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.24\"><span class=\"content\">when you lie down, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Jer. 31:26</span></span><span class=\"content\">your sleep will be sweet.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.24\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.25\"><span class=\"label\">25</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [1 Pet. 3:14]; See Ps. 91:5   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Do not be afraid of sudden terror</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.25\"><span class=\"content\">or of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Job 5:21]</span></span><span class=\"content\">the ruin</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">3:25 </span><span class=\"ft\">Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">storm</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> of the wicked, when it comes,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.25\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.26\"><span class=\"label\">26</span><span class=\"content\">for the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\"> will be your confidence</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.26\"><span class=\"content\">and will </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See 1 Sam. 2:9</span></span><span class=\"content\">keep your foot from being caught.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.26\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v27\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.27\"><span class=\"label\">27</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Gal. 6:10\n        </span></span><span class=\"content\">Do not withhold good from those to whom it is due,</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">3:27 </span><span class=\"ft\">Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">Do not withhold good from its owners</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v27\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.27\"><span class=\"content\">when it is in your power to do it.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v27\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.27\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v28\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.28\"><span class=\"label\">28</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [Lev. 19:13; Deut. 24:15]  </span></span><span class=\"content\">Do not say to your neighbor, &#8220;Go, and come again,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v28\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.28\"><span class=\"content\">tomorrow I will give it&#8221;&#8212;when you have it with you.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v28\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.28\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v29\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.29\"><span class=\"label\">29</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 6:14; 12:20; 14:22   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Do not plan evil against your neighbor,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v29\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.29\"><span class=\"content\">who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Judg. 18:7, 27]</span></span><span class=\"content\">dwells trustingly beside you.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v29\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.29\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v30\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.30\"><span class=\"label\">30</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [Rom. 12:18]  </span></span><span class=\"content\">Do not contend with a man for no reason,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v30\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.30\"><span class=\"content\">when he has done you no harm.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v30\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.30\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v31\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.31\"><span class=\"label\">31</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See Ps. 37:1   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Do not envy </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 18:48; 140:1</span></span><span class=\"content\">a man of violence</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v31\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.31\"><span class=\"content\">and do not choose any of his ways,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v31\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.31\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v32\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.32\"><span class=\"label\">32</span><span class=\"content\">for </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 2:15 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the devious person is an abomination to the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\">,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v32\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.32\"><span class=\"content\">but the upright are </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Job 29:4</span></span><span class=\"content\">in his confidence.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v32\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.32\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v33\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.33\"><span class=\"label\">33</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 37:22; Zech. 5:4; Mal. 2:2; See Lev. 26:14-39   </span></span><span class=\"content\">The </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\">&#8217;s curse is on the house of the wicked,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v33\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.33\"><span class=\"content\">but he </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Job 8:6]</span></span><span class=\"content\">blesses the dwelling of the righteous.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v33\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.33\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.34\"><span class=\"label\">34</span><span class=\"content\">Toward the </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 1:1 </span></span><span class=\"content\">scorners he </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[James 4:6; 1 Pet. 5:5; See Ps. 138:6] </span></span><span class=\"content\">is scornful,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.34\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [James 4:6; 1 Pet. 5:5]; See Ps. 138:6  </span></span><span class=\"content\">but to the humble he gives favor.</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">3:34 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">grace</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.34\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v35\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.35\"><span class=\"label\">35</span><span class=\"content\">The wise will inherit honor,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v35\" data-usfm=\"PRO.3.35\"><span class=\"content\">but fools get</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">3:35 </span><span class=\"ft\">The meaning of the Hebrew word is uncertain</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> disgrace.</span></span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>", "copyright": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers."}, "next": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["PRO.4"], "human": "Proverbs 4", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "previous": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["PRO.2"], "human": "Proverbs 2", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "reference": {"usfm": ["PRO.3"], "human": "Proverbs 3", "version_id": 59}}, "usfm": "PRO.3.NLT", "locale": "en", "versionData": {"audio": true, "copyright_short": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publisher